  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><p data-lake-id=\"u8d1b9866\" id=\"u8d1b9866\"><span data-lake-id=\"u919526ce\" id=\"u919526ce\">多任务开发，有多种实现方式，从资源占用大小排序：进程 &gt; </span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u5fa4bdd5\" id=\"u5fa4bdd5\">线程</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"udfd79cff\" id=\"udfd79cff\"> &gt; 协程</span></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"A7htX\" id=\"A7htX\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf39d3222\" id=\"uf39d3222\">线程概述</span></h2><h3 data-lake-id=\"FcwLz\" id=\"FcwLz\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u41cca69f\" id=\"u41cca69f\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">线程介绍</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u449920e2\" id=\"u449920e2\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub85f921f\" id=\"ub85f921f\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">在Python中，想要实现多任务可以使用线程来完成，线程是实现多任务的一种方式。还可以使用进程、协程实现多任务。</span></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"diyfm\" id=\"diyfm\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0386a0ca\" id=\"u0386a0ca\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">线程概念</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"ud0dfce1d\" id=\"ud0dfce1d\"><span data-lake-id=\"u35946ec1\" id=\"u35946ec1\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">进程是分配资源的基本单位, 一旦创建一个进程就会分配一定的资源,</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uc83adb60\" id=\"uc83adb60\"><span data-lake-id=\"u22084139\" id=\"u22084139\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">线程是cpu调度的基本单位，每个进程至少都有一个线程，而这个线程就是我们通常说的主线程。</span></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"Dn0Jq\" id=\"Dn0Jq\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u69953026\" id=\"u69953026\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">线程作用</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u11a6e628\" id=\"u11a6e628\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2572049f\" id=\"u2572049f\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">多线程可以完成多任务</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u13226b82\" id=\"u13226b82\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf61c81bb\" id=\"uf61c81bb\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"uf9de89c4\" id=\"uf9de89c4\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u7e225ab7\" id=\"u7e225ab7\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">多线程效果图:</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id=\"uc3f0abd5\" id=\"uc3f0abd5\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2023%2Fpng%2F27903758%2F1685187810445-edd20d19-059e-423a-8ac9-5e140799a721.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u239881a0-83b7-42e8-acb4-94dd0f896e7%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u8af3c898-9084-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1150%2C%22originHeight%22%3A470%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f6f4f3%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u3fb470a4%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"u7a011787\" id=\"u7a011787\"><br></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"r3sYV\" id=\"r3sYV\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u23e6a966\" id=\"u23e6a966\">线程编程</span></h2><h3 data-lake-id=\"ZDoFf\" id=\"ZDoFf\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u548a55c5\" id=\"u548a55c5\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">Python默认单任务</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u72062aa3\" id=\"u72062aa3\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf376df75\" id=\"uf376df75\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">接下来我们使用python代码来模拟“唱歌跳舞”这件事情</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ufd4f87f4\" id=\"ufd4f87f4\"><br></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22import%20time%5Cn%5Cn%5Cndef%20sing()%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%E5%94%B1%E6%AD%8C%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20for%20i%20in%20range(3)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20print(%5C%22%E6%AD%A3%E5%9C%A8%E5%94%B1%E6%AD%8C..%5C%22)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20time.sleep(0.5)%5Cn%5Cn%5Cndef%20dance()%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%E8%B7%B3%E8%88%9E%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20for%20i%20in%20range(3)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20print(%5C%22%E6%AD%A3%E5%9C%A8%E8%B7%B3%E8%88%9E..%5C%22)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20time.sleep(0.5)%5Cn%5Cn%5Cnif%20__name__%20%3D%3D%20'__main__'%3A%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20sing()%20%20%23%20%E6%AD%A3%E5%9C%A8%E5%94%B1%E6%AD%8C%5Cn%20%20%20%20dance()%20%23%20%E6%AD%A3%E5%9C%A8%E8%B7%B3%E8%88%9E%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22AnjId%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u794b5181\" id=\"u794b5181\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"uc83ac3d9\" id=\"uc83ac3d9\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue7f9e601\" id=\"ue7f9e601\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">运行结果如下：</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u29c26855\" id=\"u29c26855\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2023%2Fpng%2F27903758%2F1685188051238-34781f65-c1c7-4d55-b877-6dba37993c45.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u642934b0-69b0-46c7-90a3-0919a0fad58%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ub1a90ac2-6f4b-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1776%2C%22originHeight%22%3A382%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23fbfbfa%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u9039d85a%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\"></card></p><blockquote data-lake-id=\"u63e90003\" id=\"u63e90003\" class=\"lake-alert lake-alert-warning\"><ul list=\"ua4bb4fd4\"><li fid=\"ucffe6747\" data-lake-id=\"ub8fb985e\" id=\"ub8fb985e\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc201c9e8\" id=\"uc201c9e8\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">很显然刚刚的程序并没有完成唱歌和跳舞同时进行的要求</span></li></ul></blockquote><p data-lake-id=\"u4c05f316\" id=\"u4c05f316\"><span data-lake-id=\"ufa739e3f\" id=\"ufa739e3f\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">​</span><br></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"IDWER\" id=\"IDWER\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9eaca145\" id=\"u9eaca145\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">多线程完成多任务</span></h3><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22import%20threading%5Cnimport%20time%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E5%94%B1%E6%AD%8C%E4%BB%BB%E5%8A%A1%5Cndef%20sing()%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20%E6%89%A9%E5%B1%95%EF%BC%9A%20%E8%8E%B7%E5%8F%96%E5%BD%93%E5%89%8D%E7%BA%BF%E7%A8%8B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20print(%5C%22sing%E5%BD%93%E5%89%8D%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E7%9A%84%E7%BA%BF%E7%A8%8B%E4%B8%BA%EF%BC%9A%5C%22%2C%20threading.current_thread())%5Cn%20%20%20%20for%20i%20in%20range(3)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20print(%5C%22%E6%AD%A3%E5%9C%A8%E5%94%B1%E6%AD%8C...%25d%5C%22%20%25%20i)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20time.sleep(1)%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E8%B7%B3%E8%88%9E%E4%BB%BB%E5%8A%A1%5Cndef%20dance()%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20%E6%89%A9%E5%B1%95%EF%BC%9A%20%E8%8E%B7%E5%8F%96%E5%BD%93%E5%89%8D%E7%BA%BF%E7%A8%8B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20print(%5C%22dance%E5%BD%93%E5%89%8D%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E7%9A%84%E7%BA%BF%E7%A8%8B%E4%B8%BA%EF%BC%9A%5C%22%2C%20threading.current_thread())%5Cn%20%20%20%20for%20i%20in%20range(3)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20print(%5C%22%E6%AD%A3%E5%9C%A8%E8%B7%B3%E8%88%9E...%25d%5C%22%20%25%20i)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20time.sleep(1)%5Cn%5Cn%5Cnif%20__name__%20%3D%3D%20'__main__'%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20%E6%89%A9%E5%B1%95%EF%BC%9A%20%E8%8E%B7%E5%8F%96%E5%BD%93%E5%89%8D%E7%BA%BF%E7%A8%8B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20print(%5C%22%E5%BD%93%E5%89%8D%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E7%9A%84%E7%BA%BF%E7%A8%8B%E4%B8%BA%EF%BC%9A%5C%22%2C%20threading.current_thread())%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20%E5%88%9B%E5%BB%BA%E5%94%B1%E6%AD%8C%E7%9A%84%E7%BA%BF%E7%A8%8B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20target%EF%BC%9A%20%E7%BA%BF%E7%A8%8B%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E7%9A%84%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E5%90%8D%5Cn%20%20%20%20sing_thread%20%3D%20threading.Thread(target%3Dsing)%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20%E5%88%9B%E5%BB%BA%E8%B7%B3%E8%88%9E%E7%9A%84%E7%BA%BF%E7%A8%8B%5Cn%20%20%20%20dance_thread%20%3D%20threading.Thread(target%3Ddance)%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20%E5%BC%80%E5%90%AF%E7%BA%BF%E7%A8%8B%5Cn%20%20%20%20sing_thread.start()%5Cn%20%20%20%20dance_thread.start()%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22c3mj7%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u3f3a9ed2\" id=\"u3f3a9ed2\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u225b77d4\" id=\"u225b77d4\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">执行结果:</span></strong></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%E6%AD%A3%E5%9C%A8%E5%94%B1%E6%AD%8C...0%5Cn%E6%AD%A3%E5%9C%A8%E8%B7%B3%E8%88%9E...0%5Cn%E6%AD%A3%E5%9C%A8%E5%94%B1%E6%AD%8C...1%5Cn%E6%AD%A3%E5%9C%A8%E8%B7%B3%E8%88%9E...1%5Cn%E6%AD%A3%E5%9C%A8%E5%94%B1%E6%AD%8C...2%5Cn%E6%AD%A3%E5%9C%A8%E8%B7%B3%E8%88%9E...2%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ZmXYg%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h3 data-lake-id=\"tcHhD\" id=\"tcHhD\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u78f30331\" id=\"u78f30331\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">小结</span></h3><ol list=\"ufc244110\"><li fid=\"u9d626078\" data-lake-id=\"u86ca6f13\" id=\"u86ca6f13\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7b331e82\" id=\"u7b331e82\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">导入线程模块 </span><code data-lake-id=\"uf2076c39\" id=\"uf2076c39\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1b5dcdfd\" id=\"u1b5dcdfd\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">import threading</span></code></li><li fid=\"u9d626078\" data-lake-id=\"ub29eefe4\" id=\"ub29eefe4\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2b539369\" id=\"u2b539369\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">创建子线程并指定执行的任务</span><code data-lake-id=\"u8fcf2f84\" id=\"u8fcf2f84\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1c8319f7\" id=\"u1c8319f7\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">sub_thread = threading.Thread(target=任务名)</span></code></li><li fid=\"u9d626078\" data-lake-id=\"ue57a7cfe\" id=\"ue57a7cfe\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5993b245\" id=\"u5993b245\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">启动线程执行任务</span><code data-lake-id=\"u59a8385f\" id=\"u59a8385f\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc4561d94\" id=\"uc4561d94\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">sub_thread.start()</span></code></li></ol>",
